flowchart TD
    Start([Start: RaiseNewQuery]) --> Input[/Input: student_id, query_text, dept_id, category/]
    Input --> CheckEmpty{query_text empty?}
    
    CheckEmpty -- Yes --> Err1[/Return Error: Cannot be empty/]
    
    CheckEmpty -- No --> Init[Generate new_query_id & System Time]
    Init --> PopQuery[Populate query_record]
    PopQuery --> InsertDB[(Insert into D3: QUERIES)]
    
    InsertDB --> InitAudit[Populate audit_record]
    InitAudit --> InsertAudit[(Insert into D7: AUDIT_LOGS)]
    
    InsertAudit --> AsyncNotif[Call DispatchNotificationAsync: Admin Queue]
    AsyncNotif --> Output[/Return Success: new_query_id/]
    
    Output --> End([End])
    Err1 --> End